  TextFields:
  - Nemean Lion
  - "A,\r\nJust finished up at Stations 5 and 6 in northern Minnesota.  Six down,
    six to go, and then I\u2019ll get back to you.\r\n\r\nDid you know that Hercules'
    first task was to kill the Nemean lion? It was unkillable but he pulled it off.
    That story\u2019s been stuck in my head. Everything feels impossible right now.\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ve
    seen my notes, so you know why Leo\u2019s on my mind. I just hope we can figure
    this out in time.\r\n\r\nYour dad\u2019s not thrilled with me, but he\u2019ll
    come around. He always does.\r\n\r\nI like you a LOT,\r\n\r   Elijah"
